  "title": "UK Duty & VAT Calculator"
 },
 "description": "Estimate UK import duty and VAT for a commodity code using the LIVE GOV.UK Trade Tariff \u2014 rates are fetched per request, not from a static table. The CIF value is composed from customs_value + freight_cost + insurance_cost; duty = CIF x the duty rate for the origin country; VAT (typically 20%) applies on the duty-inclusive value.\n\nProvide commodity_code (6-10 digits), origin_country (ISO-2) and customs_value in GBP; freight_cost, insurance_cost and incoterm are optional refinements.\n\nBehavior: live lookup plus deterministic arithmetic on the returned rate; an unknown or non-declarable commodity code errors with HMRC's message (a 6-digit code may need extending to its 8/10-digit declarable line); origin-dependent measures the tariff cannot resolve automatically surface in warnings. Rate-limited: a limit error carries reset_at, the UTC time the allowance resets.\n\nReturns: commodity_code and description, origin country, cif_value, duty_rate (+ percent), duty_amount, vat_rate, vat_amount, total_import_taxes, total_landed_cost and warnings under result; validity.as_of marks the live-rate timestamp; plus confidence, _source and citation (the FreightUtils v1 response envelope).\n\nLimitations: an estimate, not a customs ruling \u2014 excise, quotas, anti-dumping measures, reliefs and origin-proof requirements can change the outcome; confirm with a customs broker or HMRC before relying on it.\n\nRelated: hs_code_lookup (find the 6-digit code first), incoterms_lookup (who actually pays these costs).",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "properties": {
   "commodity_code": {
    "description": "UK tariff commodity code (6-10 digits)",
    "pattern": "^\\d{6,10}$",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "customs_value": {
    "description": "Customs value in GBP",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "freight_cost": {
    "description": "Freight cost in GBP, 0 or more (default 0)",
    "minimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "incoterm": {
    "description": "Incoterm basis",
    "enum": [
     "EXW",
     "FCA",
     "FAS",
     "FOB",
     "CFR",
     "CIF",
     "CPT",
     "CIP",
     "DAP",
     "DPU",
     "DDP"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   },
   "insurance_cost": {
    "description": "Insurance cost in GBP, 0 or more (default 0)",
    "minimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "origin_country": {
    "description": "ISO 2-letter country of origin (e.g. \"CN\", \"US\")",
    "pattern": "^[A-Za-z]{2}$",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "commodity_code",
   "origin_country",
   "customs_value"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "uk_duty_calculator",
